  "stats add up: AGI 99 with DEX swept gives each alone summed; four stats at 50 give their single sweeps summed",
  "ATK from STR, DEX and LUK is one formula for every class, times the class ATK% passive: Samurai / 1.15 (Katana Mastery) and Thief / 1.20 (Killer Instinct) give the same STR curve (223.5 and 224.2 at 99); it grows from about 1.3 raw ATK per point at first to 3.7 near 99",
  "ASPD: AGI shrinks the gap to 200 by 0.46% of that gap per point (99 AGI: 45.3% Samurai, 45.6% Thief), DEX by a quarter of that; the gap itself differs by class (all stats 1: Samurai 40, Thief 34)",
  "Crit Rate = about 7.5 + k x (LUK + bonus) + passives: k is 0.3 for Samurai and 0.6 for Thief, the one real class difference found; Samurai adds Katana Mastery CRIT +20",
